   309	def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
   310	    """
   311	    Propagate the motif around the quadrants in a fixed chain and leave a trail for each step.
   312	
   313	    Input structure:
   314	    - A single monochrome divider row and divider column split the board into four 13x13 quadrants.
   315	    - Every quadrant contains exactly one red square anchor, and only the top-left quadrant contains a full colored motif attached to its anchor.
   316	    - The top-left motif is one connected non-background component; the other quadrants initially show only their red anchors.
