   319	    - First copy the top-left motif into the top-right quadrant, reflecting it according to the left-to-right move and scaling it by the TR-anchor/TL-anchor size ratio.
   320	    - Then treat the produced top-right copy as the next source: copy it into the bottom-right quadrant using the current source-target relation, and then copy the produced bottom-right result into the bottom-left quadrant the same way.

